    <section class="cuerpo-style">
        <h2>Common Issues</h2>

        <h3>The website is not loading</h3>
        <p>
            Refresh the page or check your internet connection. If the problem continues,
            try using another web browser.
        </p>

        <h3>I can't find the information I need</h3>
        <p>
            Browse the menu to explore all available pages, or visit the Contact page for
            additional assistance.
        </p>

        <h3>Images or content are not showing</h3>
        <p>
            Make sure JavaScript is enabled in your browser and that no extensions are
            blocking website content.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section class="cuerpo-style">
